### 实验004 admission webhook 竞态 — 原始输出 2026-10-05 19:10:09

## 现象：同一个文件里同时 apply Queue 与 Job
$ kubectl apply -f 002-enqueue-gate.yaml
queue.scheduling.volcano.sh/exp-queue-fail created
Error from server: error when creating "002-enqueue-gate.yaml": admission webhook "validatejob.volcano.sh" denied the request: can only submit job to queue with state `Open`, queue `exp-queue-fail` status is ``;

## 复现性验证：删掉 queue 后单独重建，再立刻提交 job
queue.scheduling.volcano.sh/race-probe created
job.batch.volcano.sh/race-probe-job created

## 复现率量化（连续 8 次，每次新建 Queue+Job 同文件提交）
结果：webhook 拒绝 7 / 通过 1（共 8 次）＝ 复现率 87.5%

